WEBVTT

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.860
Jinguuji-san!

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:12.650
Why won't you dodge?!

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:14.990
I'm sorry, Tachibana.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:18.660
I didn't know I'd made you feel so tormented.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.120
Jinguuji-san...

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:24.870
But... I've never once praised anyone,
 since the day I was born.

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.000
I don't know how to do it.

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:28.880
No idea at all.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:30.970
That makes you a crappy person!

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.590
<i>Hey! Don't interfere, Schwa-kun!</i>

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:38.010
Huh?! That's cheating!

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:41.050
Linear attacks get cut down.

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:43.360
And punches get the arms knocked off.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:44.130
In that case...

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:50.020
Episode 12

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:50.020
A Guy Who Reincarnated as a Fantasy Knockout 
and .                                                                      .

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:54.890
<i>How d'you like this?!</i>

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:59.090
We're gonna die! We're 
gonna die! We're gonna die!

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:00.290
This is all crap!

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:02.370
Schwartz, it's just as you say...

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.220
I am a crappy person.

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:04.990
What?!

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:07.120
What are you babbling about 
when I'm so freakin' busy?!

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:09.500
Whoa! Eek!

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:12.630
Simply being with me seems to hurt people.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:15.300
I thought that I was giving 
reasonable guidance,

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:15.300
Jinguuji-san...

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.720
but when the person receiving 
it feels it isn't reasonable,

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:20.710
the misunderstanding 
hurts that person's pride.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:19.570
Jinguuji-san!

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:23.560
Wha—! Jinguuji-san, wait!

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:27.590
In my case, I'm so much better 
than society at large...

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:30.750
Whoa, this is bad! I'm gonna die!

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:30.750
There aren't many people who 
can accept that about me.

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.550
If being with me is painful 
for Tachibana, then...

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:38.320
It would be better if I disappeared 
from Tachibana's sight.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:40.570
Weren't you listening?!

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:46.830
Tachibana-san just said that she's 
proud of having you as a friend!

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:51.710
SHe's unhinged enough to shoot off those 
crazy beams, but she's still saying that!

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:55.740
Those words don't come out unless you 
feel them from the bottom of your heart!

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:58.590
Right now, Tachibana-san isn't acting 
normal, no matter how you look at it.

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:02.470
Jinguuji-san, if you two fight and 
split up while she's in that state,

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:05.720
Tachibana-san will absolutely regret it!

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.660
Then what am I supposed to do?

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:10.730
He's been telling you that!

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:14.230
Please compliment Tachibana-san!

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.740
But I failed at that earlier...

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:19.570
What Tachibana-san needs right now

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:22.100
aren't words that only praise 
his appearance, like earlier...

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.740
he needs words from the 
heart of his best friend!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.280
I know that!

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.250
But...

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:31.000
What? You still have issues?!

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:32.500
Well...

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:36.370
Isn't it embarrassing? Praising someone...

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.130
Quit being a pain!

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:41.550
Wh-What are you doing?

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.140
Shut up!

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:47.890
You've dragged an entire kingdom into your 
baffling lovers' quarrel! Imagine how that feels!

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:49.900
Lovers' quarrel?

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:53.010
You're thirty-ish, but you sound
 like a whiny teenager!

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:57.650
That's why the princess can steal 
Tachibana-san away and make you all jealous!

00:02:57.980 --> 00:03:00.080
I've told you, I'm not jealous!

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:01.160
That's right!

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.280
That's the problem right there!

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:05.530
You know, normally, even between guys...

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:08.900
I think there can be jealousy, don't you?!

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:11.620
What's this you say?

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:19.420
Have you felt that way? With a guy? Jealous?

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.010
Yes, I have!

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.980
When my friend Yamazato-kun 
found a girlfriend

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:24.680
and wouldn't hang out with me at all anymore,

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:28.140
I was super jealous! Is there 
something weird about that?!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:32.560
You keep your distance from Tachibana-san 
because you're guys or whatever,

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:36.330
but being that self-conscious of 
it is actually weirder...

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:38.690
I see. It's normal, is it?

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:41.010
It's normal.

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:46.830
<i>I was scolded and told I was 
spoiled for relying on others.</i>

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:50.170
<i>I was rebuked and told 
that tears weren't good.</i>

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:55.150
<i>"Never waver. Always conduct 
yourself in a dignified way."</i>

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:56.650
<i>"Set an example for the rest of society."</i>

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:58.020
<i>That's how I was raised.</i>

00:03:58.020 --> 00:03:59.340
Jinguuji-san?

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:05.210
<i>"Never show your weaknesses."</i>

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:06.750
<i>"Never show vulnerability."</i>

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.730
<i>"Be strong. That is how you will 
be able to survive on your own."</i>

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.780
<i>"Baring your heart to another..."</i>

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:17.540
<i>"is showing vulnerability."</i>

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:19.610
But!

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:22.870
Guys can be jealous with each other!

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.740
That's normal!

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:28.100
Right?!

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.740
Huh?! Uh, yes! That's right! Probably!

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.580
In that case!

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.210
How's that?

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:46.340
Then it's high time that I let myself 
be honest with my best friend, at least.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.220
Right, Schwartz?!

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.100
Exactly!

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:52.100
Why?

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.860
Why do you stop me, Jinguuji?

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:57.600
I've held back all this time!

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.860
You know, at times like this...

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:03.860
you could let me feel good, 
just a little, couldn't you?!

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.360
I envied you!

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:09.460
You always had people around you!

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:12.620
And you were always
 surrounded by smiles!

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:18.500
Just being there made me feel warm inside!

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.940
Earlier you were saying that 
you don't have anything,

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:25.010
but you still have so much that I don't!

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:27.580
That's how you look to me!

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:33.910
But do you think he really 
means what he says?

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:36.280
In spite of how many years 
you've spent together,

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:39.520
you don't know how he 
feels deep in his heart.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.880
He's very intelligent.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:45.280
He could hide whatever feelings 
he likes, couldn't he?

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:49.070
Just as you hid your jealousy of him.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.280
That's right.

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:54.200
Deep in your heart, you're 
laughing at me, aren't you?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.460
After all, I've been envious 
of you all this time...

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:59.790
and I've felt like it was unfair 
that I had no talents...

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:03.050
No matter what I did, 
I never lasted very long...

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:06.880
And despite not doing nearly as much,
 I'm the one who complained the most!

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.930
But you could do everything!

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:11.250
The difference between us was clear!

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:13.820
You've got tons of certificates 
of recognition!

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:16.430
You were the student council president 
and the student representative!

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.230
You're so popular it could kill you!

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.840
You never tolerated bad things happening...

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.910
You rescued the weak...

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:29.330
I've thought all this since 
the moment I met you.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:30.990
We were in the same class...

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.760
but you never talked to anyone, ever...

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.740
I didn't even know your name!

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:38.550
Hey, are you all right?

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:42.000
That's right! I was jealous!

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:46.510
All this time, I've wanted to be like you!

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.960
To me, you were...

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.090
just like...

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.810
You were just like a ****!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.440
You were like a hero!

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.690
I admired you!

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:09.070
Is it strange?

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.320
<b><i>Kawa City Yuikawa 
Elementary School 
Student Compositions</i></b>

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.320
I mean...

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:13.140
wanting to be that when 
you grow up is kinda...

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:18.580
But I think it's great.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.330
Predictions for the Future

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.330
1: What do you dream of being in the future? 
<i>A Hero</i> 
2: What will you be doing when you've turned 18?
<i>Going to university</i>
3: What will you be doing when you've turned 60?
<i>Sweeping up after others</i>
Memories of the last 6 years:
<i>Nothing in particular</i>

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:20.160
A hero.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.410
It... stopped moving?

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:38.050
Huh? Is it making a gross noise?

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:39.580
The sound of vomiting, I think.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:47.040
Wh-Wh-What's that noise? What's going on?!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.610
An error warning, I think.

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:53.180
Error. Error. Unknown interference 
with energy detected.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:58.470
Change to rhesus mode immediately.

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:03.210
Starting now, all life forms in 
the vicinity will be annihilated.

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:05.600
What is this?

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:06.340
It seems pretty bad.

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:15.340
This couldn't be...

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:18.970
<b><i>Homing</i></b>

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:18.970
<b><i>Lasers</i></b>

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.970
Isn't this the type of mark that 
tracks you even if you run?!

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.100
<b><i>That type of mark</i></b>

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.100
Yes, it is.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.920
This is bad! What're we 
gonna do, Jinguuji-san?!

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:26.290
As far as I know, that "annihilation" 
word the rhesus thing said is bad!

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:26.980
Calm down.

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:31.400
What we must do has only become clearer.

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:34.280
In short, I will rescue Tachibana.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.910
After that, I just need to destroy Mehpon.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.580
Will you help me?

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:40.290
No...

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.440
Cover me, Schwa-kun!

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:44.870
Leave it to me!

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.090
I have already...

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:51.800
seen through that!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.220
Jinguuji-san!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.300
Right!

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:14.150
She really went and made something 
uncalled-for, that crappy goddess!

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:15.670
It's time...

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.780
to give Tachibana back!

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:31.590
Are you all right, Tachibana?

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:34.350
It's just like the morning of a hangover.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:36.760
Hey!

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.340
Are you conscious?

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.870
Jinguuji?

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:50.930
<i>B-Blast it...</i>

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:52.670
<i>It's been a while, so I let my guard down!</i>

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:55.020
<i>Those teary eyes have incredible power!</i>

00:09:56.450 --> 00:10:01.280
I-I... How could I do something 
so pathetic at my age...

00:10:01.590 --> 00:10:04.290
To you, Jinguuji, and to the 
people of this kingdom...

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:07.290
I've caused problems for all kinds of people.

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:10.410
I let myself get swept up 
into helping the rebellion.

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:12.960
Before I knew it, I was 
on a rampage with a robot.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.610
It's inexcusable.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:18.020
I hate myself.

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:21.370
I really don't have anything to my credit any more.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:26.750
Tachibana.

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:29.310
I will only say this once, so listen closely.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:30.820
I...

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:36.440
I think you're really amazing. 
I think you're a good person.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.320
The way you're considerate of people...

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:40.480
The way you never fail to follow up...

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:43.700
You pay attention to the sensibilities 
of detail-oriented people.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.610
You make so many friends of the 
same gender, unlike me...

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:49.000
I think that's because you're 
a person of good character.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:51.920
You're kind...

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:55.140
and bosses tend to hate you, 
but your juniors adore you.

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.670
You're always upbeat.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:59.470
You've got a great smile. 
You're really expressive.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:01.220
Animals really take to you.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.060
You never get cocky.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:06.660
When you're in the bathroom, if there's 
no toilet paper, you replace it.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:08.310
And you're smarter than you think.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:10.980
Even in athletics, it's not like you're bad.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:14.820
A long time ago, when I was having a hard 
time, you helped me. That understanding...

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:18.820
The puzzling way you make people laugh 
with jokes that aren't even funny...

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:21.680
When you're there, the 
atmosphere turns gentler,

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.900
and that alone has saved me so many times.

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:28.170
The way you cry helplessly at animal movies 
or videos of kids going on errands...

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:31.620
Even when something is clearly staged, 
you still whole-heartedly enjoy it.

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:34.000
The way you try anything 
that's popular just because.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.840
The fact that once you 
found out I like whiskey,

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:38.060
and you have it on hand even 
though you don't like it.

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:42.020
You might do it because you lack confidence, 
but the way you praise me excessively...

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:45.690
The way tha, when anyone meets with 
misfortune, you're always sad for them...

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:48.100
The way you'll cry for your friends.

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.890
The way you understand others are their own
 person and keep an appropriate distance.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:54.440
The way that once you empathize with 
someone, you never abandon them.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:57.320
The way that, even if they 
hate you, you never hate them.

00:11:57.320 --> 00:12:01.950
How oblivious you are, even if that 
means you aren't keen to danger.

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:05.510
The way you always tell the staff at
 restaurants that the food was good.

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:08.790
You always enjoy yourself at
 sports and cultural festivals.

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:11.700
They way you get unexpectedly 
upset when you lose.

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:15.170
When you pull a "Great Misfortune" omikuji, 
you think it makes you lucky instead.

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:17.320
The way animals are weirdly attracted to you.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.770
The way you share videos that made you laugh.

00:12:19.770 --> 00:12:23.000
The way you can't stand horror movies,
 but end up watching them anyway.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:26.920
The way you never have a handkerchief, 
but you've always got bandages with you.

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:28.560
The way you have terrible taste in women.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:30.150
The way you're weirdly childlike.

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:33.270
The way you'll say it's a good day just 
because the morning weather's nice.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.860
The way you like Hokkaido and Okinawa.

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:39.640
The way, no matter what you say, you care 
about your family more than anything.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:41.010
The way you like children.

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:43.370
The way you're way too nice 
to your much younger sister.

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:46.200
The way you fold in a week 
even when you're really angry.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:49.680
The way you ask if it's okay before 
squeezing lemon over the chicken karaage.

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:53.080
The way you deliberately say things 
to make me relax when I'm nervous.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.320
The way that even when I take you 
to a shop that isn't your style,

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:59.800
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh...

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.420
you always seem to have fun.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.800
The way you can unabashedly 
say embarrassing things.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:02.120
The way you interact with 
me like it's no big deal.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:04.120
The way you say everything 
you eat is delicious.

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:06.090
The way that, in spite of that, 
you actually hate green peppers.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:09.290
The way you never finish your 
sentences when you get drunk.

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:10.990
The way you're so expressive.

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:13.150
The way you'll give up 
your seat on the train.

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:14.710
The fact that you're better 
at drawing than I am.

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.710
The way you make sure to shave 
your face properly every day.

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:18.760
The way you make sure to always 
say "thank you for this meal."

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:21.160
The way that you make up your mind 
to do a thing when you do a thing.

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:22.230
In short!

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:23.670
I...

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:26.490
rate you higher than the average person!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:29.490
Is that not enough praise yet?

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.800
N-No, that's enough...

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:34.490
Earlier, you told me to 
praise you more, didn't you?

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:39.130
Listen up! Once I start 
praising you, I can't stop!

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:43.850
A-All right.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:47.760
I get it! That's enough! 
I get what you're saying.

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:51.240
It's more than enough! I get 
it already, so please stop!

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:52.280
Are you feeling embarrassed?

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:53.770
Anyone would, normally!

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:06.120
Wh-Why are you laughing all 
of a sudden? It's creepy.

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.260
Huh? Oh, well...

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:12.480
I was just thinking that I should 
live a little more honestly.

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.530
Should we head back, Tachibana?

00:14:19.280 --> 00:14:21.340
Yeah, we should.

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:28.720
<i>This guy...</i>

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.130
<i>He can laugh like that, huh?</i>

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:38.060
What's wrong?

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:39.940
Nothing.

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:46.860
Damage to motive power section detected.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:51.950
P-58 will self-destruct in a few seconds!

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:55.950
Escape!

00:14:55.950 --> 00:15:00.960
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a Total Fantasy Knockout

00:14:55.950 --> 00:15:00.960
<b>Little Sister</b>

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:58.310
Hina-chan, I'm taking your chicken karaage.

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:00.500
I'll give you mine.

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:04.960
I'm really sorry.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:08.090
On top of kidnapping your daughter...

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:13.130
to have her rebellion turn into something 
this huge... How can I ever apologize?

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:14.470
Honored hero.

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:18.330
I am the one who should 
apologize for my daughter.

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:23.680
No! It was me! 
I am overwhelmingly more sorry!

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:23.680
No, no.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:28.270
No, I'm sorry! Everything 
started with my daughter.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.590
Both of you, raise your heads.

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:35.450
Half of this is your fault, you know.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:39.300
Humans all make one or two mistakes.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:44.450
Aren't you just saying great things 
so that what you did stays vague?

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:48.090
Oh, you've grown up so well, Yggie!

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:51.160
If her smokescreen's working, 
I suppose everything's fine.

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:54.720
It's probably best not to seek out 
someone to take responsibility.

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:58.040
If that head maid hadn't been hired...

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:00.480
If Tachibana hadn't followed the princess...

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:03.230
If Mouria had managed to rescue them...

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:06.240
Once you start naming things, 
there's no end to it.

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:08.730
All the blame should rest on the head maid.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:10.470
The head maid, is it?

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:13.720
Cutting off your head in apology is...

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:13.720
Since she named herself one of the Demon 
Lord's subordinates and took Vizzd with her,

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:17.380
we should consider her to 
have been an involved party.

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:20.700
They really got us.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:24.870
I thought that we'd be able to take 
over this one kingdom so easily.

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:28.000
I don't like this anymore! I'm going home!

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:33.040
Once I get home, I'm going to have the 
Demon Lord pat my head and comfort me!

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:35.760
This once, I agree with you.

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.830
Shall we head home?

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:40.520
I'm going home!

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:44.300
Who'd have thought they'd attack so directly.

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:48.270
Just as the goddess said, 
this is no time to go to war.

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:52.130
We must defeat the Demon 
Lord as quickly as possible.

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:53.400
That's what it means, right?

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:54.700
Huh?

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.530
Yeah.

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:58.350
Hero, are you leaving already?

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:01.660
Well... The Demon Lord's 
forces know where we are,

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.750
so we'll probably cause you a lot of trouble.

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.280
This has always been a 
really urgent journey...

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:07.790
so we'll leave tomorrow.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:11.120
I see. You're already leaving.

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:14.170
I'd finally made my first friend, but...

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:15.750
Yu-chan...

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:19.120
Don't worry!

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:21.240
Yu-chan, you've got a great personality,

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:24.280
so if you think of someone 
like me as a friend,

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:26.700
then you could make a bunch 
of friends if you wanted to.

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:28.040
Hero...

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:28.980
Tachibana.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:31.480
Stop saying "someone like me."

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:36.280
Don't put yourself down 
to lift someone else up.

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:39.490
You are a better person than you realize.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:43.310
Though, how thoroughly considerate
 of others is one of your virtues...

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:45.530
All right! I take it 
back, okay? Just stop it!

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:46.320
Huh?

00:17:47.490 --> 00:17:51.200
I want to hurry up and beat the Demon 
Lord so I can go back to my old self...

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:54.010
I feel the same way, however...

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:59.050
To think we've come this far and still 
don't know where the Demon Lord is.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.760
Huh? Tachibana-san...

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.260
You guys don't know where the Demon Lord is?

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:05.270
I know.

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:07.300
I know where the Demon Lord's castle is.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.080
You do?

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:09.980
Yes.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:14.030
Huh? Tachibana-san,
 didn't the goddess tell you?

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:16.900
See that big white thing?

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:19.030
That's it.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:19.030
<b>That</b>

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:22.350
Why didn't you tell us?

00:18:22.350 --> 00:18:24.290
Huh? Well, I mean...

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.320
You never asked.

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:28.030
And I never imagined you didn't know.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:31.650
She said it was near the 
belly button, so probably...

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:33.420
it must be around here, right?

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.120
For now, we've decided on a destination.

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:37.360
Yes.

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:42.430
It's been a long time since I've been home!

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:45.930
Your own pillows are always the best, right?

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:49.560
Are you sure? About suddenly 
deciding to leave tomorrow.

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:52.000
Well, we're in a hurry, right?

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:54.070
And we know where we're headed.

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.320
After all that happened,

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:57.750
aren't you tired?

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.820
There are some things regarding the 
religion that I want to look into.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:04.160
And we have the tiara back.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.380
Even if we stay two days or so...

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:09.190
That's true...

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:12.580
Well, I don't mind if we do, but...

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:15.410
<i>What's this? What's wrong with me?</i>

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:17.090
<i>Why am I looking away?</i>

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.090
What's wrong?

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:23.410
Oh, nothing. Nothing at all. Nothing's wrong.

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:28.100
If there is anything, do 
not hesitate to tell me.

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:30.410
Given our relationship...

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:33.580
you can tell me anything and it'll be fine.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:38.370
Hey, Tachibana. Why do you 
keep avoiding looking at me?

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:41.490
What is it? Am I saying something weird?

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:44.300
No. You're not weird.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:46.870
If I had to say, it's me that's strange.

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:48.870
Strange?

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:53.120
I see. Your face is a little 
red. Do you have a fever?

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:56.880
Are you feeling sick? Or is 
it exhaustion, as I thought?

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:58.380
Let's take your temperature.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:19:59.880
And keep you warm.

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:01.380
Do you want some water?

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.970
Stop it, idiot!

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:04.820
Stop being nice to me!

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:07.720
And you've been way too close to me 
for a while now! It's creeping me out!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:10.120
Your changing clothes is unsightly, 
so go do it in the hallway...

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:10.980
Ta—

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:12.900
Tachibana, you...

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.050
over your head...

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:18.230
<b>♥ Charmed</b>

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:19.730
Huh?

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:22.240
<b>♥ Charmed</b>

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:26.990
<b>demrahC♥</b>

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:26.990
Are you all right, Tachibana?!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:30.840
Does this look all right to you?!

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:32.410
It doesn't, but why are you...

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:35.380
This is because I'm tired! Because I'm tired!

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:39.890
I see! I-It's caused by fatigue... is it?

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:43.580
So, this is where we say goodbye, huh?

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:45.640
Yes. Thank you for looking after me.

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:47.760
You're really not coming with us?

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:49.840
You're sure about this, Schwartz?

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:51.550
I'm in a whole other world.

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:53.600
And I want to see my master's homeland.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:57.230
Our destinations are the same, so 
I'm sure we'll see each other again.

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:02.820
At the very end, we friends who have fought 
side by side will join forces once more,

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:06.260
and by combining our powers, 
we shall crush the enemy!

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:08.070
What do you think of that course of events?

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:10.620
I mean, even if you ask what I think...

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:13.370
I know it's tough to part ways.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.870
You two have taught me so much.

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:19.580
That I should never be 
deceived by appearances...

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:23.060
That it feels pretty good to 
hit someone as hard as I can...

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:25.630
<i>He hasn't learned a single decent thing.</i>

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:28.890
Well, I am a little 
reluctant to part as well.

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:31.890
It's rare for you to say 
something like that, Jinguuji.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:35.180
Yes. I haven't hit him back yet.

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:37.680
I'm joking.

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:38.620
<i>That's a lie.</i>

00:22:24.350 --> 00:22:25.890
Well, shall we go?

00:22:25.890 --> 00:22:26.820
Yeah.

00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:37.580
<i>I-It's no good. I can't bring 
myself to look at him!</i>

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:39.440
<i>Blast it. This is troublesome.</i>

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:42.090
<i>Having Tachibana affected by 
the goddess's curse, too...</i>

00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:44.320
<i>This is bad. Really bad.</i>

00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:48.090
<i>With this synergistic effect, 
it's affecting me even me more...</i>

00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:48.090
<i>This is bad. Really bad. Seriously 
bad! So bad I'm gonna hurl!</i>

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:51.090
<i>What if we're both charmed at the same time?!</i>

00:22:51.560 --> 00:22:53.850
<i>And when we suddenly come to our senses...</i>

00:23:09.390 --> 00:23:11.110
<i>There's no telling what could happen!</i>

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:14.990
<i>We must break this curse as soon as possible!</i>

00:23:14.990 --> 00:23:19.000
<i>In this moment, their two 
hearts were once again one.</i>

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:21.750
Let's do this, Jinguuji.

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:25.750
Yes. We two will absolutely 
defeat the Demon Lord!

00:23:26.520 --> 00:23:29.160
<i>Before I fall in love with this guy!</i>

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:34.660
<i>This tale is a romantic comedy between an 
old guy and someone who used to be an old guy.</i>
